<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Alza started as attractive.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Alza started as attractive.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Vector Securities analyst Patricia Bank said she started coverage of Alza Corp with an attractive rating.</p>
<p>--Shares in the drug delivery company were up 1/8 to 29-1/8.</p>
<p>--&quot;We suggest that longer-term investors seeking to build a position in a core drug delivery holding accumulate the stock,&quot; Bank said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
